// The FTP account of a `solarlog_hosted` source on noonside's FTP server. FTP and FTPS (explicit TLS)
// on `port`, passive mode; the account only sees its own directory. Each upload starts an import
// (after 30 s without further uploads). Imported minute files are deleted after `retention_days`,
// other files after a day; the server refuses uploads beyond `quota_bytes`.
